{"title":"Scorpion Stinger","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Deathstalker Scorpion, Dune Scorpion, Rock Scorpion</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-scorpion\" title=\"Dune Scorpion - dropped it in 8 of 17 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7850b285aa7a06eea064.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Scorpion</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–15</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"rock-scorpion\" title=\"Rock Scorpion - dropped it in 7 of 15 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/5fab85beeea545234ca0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rock Scorpion</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×2–10</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"deathstalker-scorpion\" title=\"Deathstalker Scorpion - dropped it in 12 of 28 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/53fd415b972a02d5f9d9.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deathstalker Scorpion</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–9</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scorpion-stinger\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/977ab05583e7ccda91b0.svg\" alt=\"Scorpion Stinger\"></div><h3>Scorpion Stinger</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/29/2026, 10:25:46 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}